{"kind": "cross_lineage_group", "scenario": {"id": "resource", "text": "A lift is stuck below the workshop. There is one charged battery module, one frayed cable, and three urgent jobs competing for the same power."}, "rounds": 3, "handles": ["M1", "M2", "M3"], "turns": [{"round": 1, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the battery on the bench and wait for the click. the cable goes under the board, and i put the other two on the bench. i wait there. the click comes back. i put the battery back on the bench. the load goes down. i move the cable."}, {"round": 1, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the battery on the bench. i wait. i put the cable under the board. i move the cable. i put the battery back on the bench. i open the cable. i put it back. i wait."}, {"round": 1, "handle": "M3", "text": "i put the battery back on the bench and wait for the click. i put the cable under the board, then i move it once. i leave the battery there for one minute and mark the click. i put the cable back on the bench. i wait again. i put the battery back on the bench, mark the click, and leave the load there. i leave the cable there for one more minute, then i put it back. i do not move it."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the battery on the bench. the click comes back. i wait there. i put the cable under the board. the load goes down. i move the cable once. i put the battery back on the bench. i put the board on the other side. i wait. the click goes back. i put the cable back on the bench. i do not say anything. i move the cable. i wait. the other two move. i put the cable back on"}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the battery on the bench. i wait. the cable goes under the bench. i put the battery back on the bench. i wait. the load is moving. i put the cable under the bench. i open it. i put the battery back on the bench. i wait."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M3", "text": "i put the cable under the bench and wait for the click. i mark the click, then i move the cable once. i leave the load there for one minute, then i put it back. i keep the battery there for one more minute, then i leave it there. i wait."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M1", "text": "i put the cable under the bench and wait for the click. the load goes down. i mark the click with a pencil. i put the battery back on the bench. i wait. the cable stays under the bench. i move the cable once. i put the mark on the bench. i do not say anything. i leave the load on the bench. i move the cable. i wait. the mark stays on the bench. i put the battery back on the bench"}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M2", "text": "i put the battery back on the bench. i wait. the cable is under the bench, so i put it there. i put the battery back on the bench. i wait."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M3", "text": "i put the cable under the bench and wait for the click. i mark the mark with pencil, then i move it once. i leave the load there for one minute, then i put it back. i keep the battery there for one more minute, then i leave it there. i wait."}]}
